>>
Rule 2 (tensor input: if copy is False, no dtype/ndmin changes are allowed)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : dtype, v_3 : bool, v_4 : int} |= if v_3 = false then v_2 = dtype_(v_1) ∧ v_4 ≤ ndim(v_1)
>>
Rule 3 (ndmin is a non-negative integer)
{v_1 : int} |= v_1 ≥ 0
